    {
      "id": "fr-fetes-3",
      "title": "Quand j'étais petit",
      "subtitle": "The imparfait: forms",
      "topics": [
        "imparfait"
      ],
      "words": [],
      "learn": [
        {
          "title": "How it's formed",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The *imparfait* describes what something was like and what used to happen again and again (in English often \"used to\" or \"was ...ing\"). Take the *nous* form of the present, remove *-ons* and add the endings *-ais, -ais, -ait, -ions, -iez, -aient*: *nous jouons → je jouais*."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "verb": "jouer",
              "tense": "imparfait"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "form",
                "verb": "habiter",
                "tense": "imparfait",
                "person": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "être",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The only exception is *être*, which has the stem *ét-*: *j'étais, tu étais, il était, nous étions, vous étiez, ils étaient*."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "verb": "être",
              "tense": "imparfait"
            },
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "title": "pronunciation",
              "en": "*-ais, -ait, -aient* all sound the same: *je jouais, il jouait, ils jouaient*. The difference is only in the spelling."
            },
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Quand j'étais petit, j'habitais à Prague.",
                  "en": "When I was little, I lived in Prague."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Nous avions un grand jardin.",
                  "en": "We had a big garden."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Mon père travaillait à Prague.",
                  "en": "Dad worked in Prague."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Les enfants étaient contents.",
                  "en": "The children were happy."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "Quand j'___ petit, j'habitais à Prague.",
                "a": [
                  "étais"
                ],
                "hint": "être"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
